  "summary": "Full stack developer with four years at True Leaf Market, a multi-brand Shopify retailer (6 stores, 6,000+ SKUs). I work across the storefronts end to end: a headless Hydrogen/React Router storefront on Cloudflare Workers, two Liquid storefronts, Laravel/MySQL internal tools, and the Shopify Admin GraphQL integrations connecting every store to the warehouse system.\n\nRecent work: led the flagship store's migration from Liquid to headless Hydrogen (30% faster page loads), built a multi-tenant Shopify Partner app that onboards new stores with no code changes, shipped a server-side Meta Conversions API integration, and engineered a consent layer that gates every third-party script for CCPA/GDPR compliance.\n\nI translate business requirements into working systems, trace problems to root cause, and ship solutions that remove manual work for the teams around me.",
