    "description": "Developer for True Leaf Market, a multi-brand Shopify retailer (6 stores, 6,000+ SKUs). Work across the storefronts end to end: a headless Hydrogen/React Router storefront on Cloudflare Workers, two Liquid storefronts, Laravel/MySQL internal tools, and the Shopify Admin GraphQL integrations connecting every store to the warehouse system. Build the frontend, API, and automation layers that marketing, ops, and customers rely on.\n\nKey accomplishments:\n• Led migration of the flagship store from Liquid to a headless Hydrogen/Remix stack, improving page load speed 30% and Core Web Vitals, then upgraded to React Router v7 with zero downtime\n• Built order, inventory, and tracking sync across six stores on Admin GraphQL bulk operations, and architected a multi-tenant Shopify Partner app (Laravel, GraphQL, Fly.io) that installs on any store via OAuth\n• Implemented a server-side Meta Conversions API route in Hydrogen with hashed user data and event deduplication\n• Built a React/Remix self-service lookup page backed by a Rust API layer, replacing manual customer-service requests\n• Engineered a server- and client-side consent layer that gates every third-party script for CCPA/GDPR compliance",
